  "text": "## Technology Stack\n\nAVENIQ utilizes modern cross-platform technologies and secure cloud infrastructure for mobile development:\n\n- **Mobile Framework**: React Native, Expo (Bare / Managed Workflow)\n- **Programming Language**: TypeScript\n- **State & Data Management**: React Query, Redux Toolkit, Context API\n- **Backend & Database**: Node.js, Express, Supabase, PostgreSQL\n- **Push Notifications & Analytics**: Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM), Expo Notifications\n- **Payments & Authentication**: Stripe Mobile SDK, Apple Pay, Google Pay, Supabase Auth\n\n---",
